insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',6,'The passage implies that convenience may encourage people to use a service, but it does not guarantee satisfaction in schools, as described in an evaluation report in a summer student forum context.','The passage says convenience always guarantees satisfaction.','The passage denies that convenience affects service use.','The passage argues that inconvenient services attract the most users.','The passage suggests that a convenient service can attract users without necessarily satisfying them.','D','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_49", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'B2','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',7,'The committee approved the plan only after several risks had been identified and addressed for adult learners, as described in a committee meeting in a advanced student forum context.','The plan was accepted once the committee had dealt with the risks it found.','The plan was accepted although no risks were identified.','The committee rejected the plan because all risks were addressed.','The committee approved the plan before considering any risks.','A','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_49", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'C1','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',6,'The decline in complaints was gradual, so managers were careful not to attribute it to a single change in public institutions, as described in a student guide in a introductory student forum context.','Managers blamed a single change because complaints rose quickly.','Because complaints decreased slowly, managers avoided saying that one change alone caused the improvement.','Managers ignored the decline because it was caused by one change.','The decline in complaints was sudden and easy to explain.','B','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_49", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'B2','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',6,'The writer contrasts short-term popularity with long-term reliability during periods of change, as described in a pilot study in a coastal research briefing context.','The writer says popularity and reliability are exactly the same.','The writer discusses reliability without mentioning popularity.','The writer points out a difference between being popular now and being dependable over time.','The writer argues that long-term reliability is impossible.','C','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_49", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'B2','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',6,'Although financial education was initially criticized, later evidence showed that it could be useful when applied carefully in small communities, as described in a professional workshop in a urban research briefing context.','The usefulness of financial education was accepted before anyone criticized it.','Early criticism proved that financial education had no value at all.','Later evidence showed that financial education should never be applied.','Later evidence suggested that financial education, despite early criticism, may have value if used carefully.','D','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_49", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'B2','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',6,'The report does not claim that reading aloud solves every problem; it argues only that it can reduce one specific difficulty when resources are limited, as described in a policy review in a northern research briefing context.','According to the report, reading aloud is not a complete solution but may help with a particular problem.','The report rejects the idea that reading aloud can help in any way.','The report argues that reading aloud solves all problems completely.','The report discusses many solutions but never mentions a specific problem.','A','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_49", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'B2','approved',false);
